It is not currently possible to upload data directly to the running shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> application.

Per the documentation <http://docs.rstudio.com/shinyapps.io/Storage.html>, the storage should be considered ephemeral, and it will go away once the application goes to sleep.

Persistent storage is on our roadmap, but we can't say what the timeline might be.

